WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.200
Episode 5

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.200
Escape from the Floating Island!!
The Wave Motion Gun Draws Danger Near!!

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.200
( Air date: Nov 03, 1974 )

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.350
Saraba Chikyuu yo

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.150
Tabidatsu fune wa...

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:40.300
...uchuu senkan Yamato

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.130
Space Battleship

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.130
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:43.750
Ucyuu no kanata Iscandar he...

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.150
...unmei seoi...

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:48.160
...ima tobitatsu

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.460
Kanarazu koko he...

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.550
...kaette kuru to

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:58.270
Te wo furu hito ni...

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:03.350
...egao de kotae

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.640
Ginga wo hanare...

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:06.950
...Iscandar he...

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:10.150
...harubaru nozomu

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:16.850
Uchuu senkan Yamato

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:41.140
{GAMILUS}Mankind is facing extinction in one year
due to Gamilus' radioactive meteor bombs.

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:47.760
{SORE}The radioactive poison purifier is on
Iscandar, which is 148,000 light years away.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:52.130
{ISCANDAR}In order to reach Iscandar, we
have to exceed the speed of light.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:56.880
{KOUSITE}So a warp test was carried
out and it was successful.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.110
{YAMATO}The Yamato became the first spaceship
from Earth to exceed the speed of light.

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:05.830
{SHIKASHI}But the Yamato's
armor plating cracked.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.620
{YAMATO}Still, the Yamato
overcame this hardship...

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:12.790
{YAMATO}...and is about to begin a space
journey of 148,000 light years.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:17.040
The Yamato has left Mars.

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.550
It's alright.
Turn it off.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:22.630
Earth finally developed a ship that can
travel faster than the speed of light.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:26.380
It's almost impossible for
current Earth technology.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:28.800
I wonder if they've received
aid from another planet.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:33.220
We have to destroy the Yamato to
save face for the Pluto frontline base.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.380
The ship is shaking.
Shima, slow the ship down.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.680
Captain, our repairs
might have failed.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.840
No, it's the engine.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:15.590
Engineer Yabu, there is an unusual
vibration.  Hurry and check.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.800
Damn, I can't control it.

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:30.450
Dammit.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.480
Captain, a gravity
field is acting on us.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:43.900
Magnify.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.040
It's Jupiter.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:52.730
{MOKUSEI}Jupiter orbits
the Sun every 12 years.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:55.280
{CHOKKEI}Jupiter's diameter is
11 times of Earth.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:59.220
{CHOKKEI}Its mass is 300 times, and its volume
is more than 1000 times that of Earth's.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:02.360
{SHIKASHI}We don't know if
there is solid land.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:08.520
If there is, the core could be pasty
liquid hydrogen and hydrogen metal.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.280
{SAIJOUSOU}There's a cloud of ammonia
in the outer layer...

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.750
{SAIJOUSOU}...and its thickness is
several thousand kilometers.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:26.880
Captain, once the Yamato is pulled
into the high-density sea of methane...

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.840
...it won't be
able to get out.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:32.680
This isn't the time
to worry about that.

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:38.140
Captain, there's a failure in
the energy transfer pipe.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.670
Captain, the Yamato is being
pulled in even farther.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:53.070
Raise the bow.  Try to prevent entering
the sea of methane as much as possible.

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:53.780
Aye, sir.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:09.430
Gravity is very strong, and
the pressure is increasing.

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.810
The radar is detecting
an unidentified object.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.300
Is it a ship ?

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.000
No, it's a lot bigger.

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.000
Switch to the
infrared monitor.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:24.560
It's no good !  The image isn't clear,
because of the sea of methane.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.860
Prepare the shock cannons.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.020
Wait, Kodai.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.430
A floating island.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:43.730
The floating island is
about the size of Australia.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:51.930
It revolves in a fixed orbit in the
clouds, or the sea of methane.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.190
Shima, emergency landing.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.830
Land on the floating island.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.140
Thank goodness.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.080
We can repair the
energy transfer pipe.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.280
Chief navigator,
I'm counting on you.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:03.280
Alright.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.340
Shima, don't go
under the island.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:13.370
The Yamato can't withstand such
pressure, and it'll be crushed.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:14.690
Shima...

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:02.270
The Yamato appears to have landed
on the floating island of Jupiter.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.830
Landed on the
floating island ?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.230
Do they even know that
there's another frontline base ?

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:12.100
It could have been pulled
in by Jupiter's gravity.

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:15.990
The Desler Medal is mine.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.750
Tell the floating island
base to find the Yamato.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.640
Aye, sir.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.280
Hey Robot,
how's the outside ?

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:44.050
Have you found any
problems around the Yamato ?

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:50.300
Thick steam. Vision 2 meters,
methane 67%, carbonic acid gas 21%.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.290
No problem.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.200
No problem.

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:08.140
Chief Engineer, how's the repair work ?

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:11.540
The energy transfer pipe has melted
and broken.  Please, give me a while.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.580
To the frontline base on the floating island,
I'm relaying Commander Shultz's orders.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:31.300
Launch a space combat boat
and investigate the Yamato.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.580
Unidentified flying object.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:48.230
On the infrared video monitor.

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:52.570
Damn, I can't identify it.
There's only one.

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:55.690
I'll go.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.010
Launch.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.960
The target is
closing rapidly.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:30.050
How brave to come by yourself,
but I can't let you see the Yamato.

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:55.920
Kodai...

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.680
Damn, he's good.

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:16.180
How impudent. Order an intensive
missile attack to destroy the Yamato.

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:16.950
Aye, sir.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:23.280
Captain, if we accelerate using the
velocity of the floating island...

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:27.880
...the Yamato should be able to
leave the gravity field of Jupiter.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:31.250
Alright, proceed.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:39.530
Prepare to launch
missiles continuously.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.810
Open all silos.

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:52.900
Launch.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.490
Repairs on the energy
transfer pipe are finished.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.440
Alright, start
the sub-engines.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.140
Starting the sub-engines.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:31.830
Contacting the starter motor.

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.990
Two seconds to
engage the flywheel.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:38.220
Engage.

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:42.430
Motor revolution 80... 90...
The gyrocompass has activated.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.000
Wave Motion engine
activation key inserted.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:46.760
Unlock the pressure plate.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.350
Contacting the energy
point in ten seconds...

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.360
...nine...

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.390
...eight...

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.570
...seven...

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:54.840
...six...

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.450
...five...

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:57.490
...four...

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.100
Incoming missiles !

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:59.000
...three...

00:13:59.000 --> 00:13:59.990
...two...

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:00.830
...one...

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:01.690
Activate.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:02.740
Activating.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.300
All ahead full.
Pitch angle 32 degrees. Take off.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:49.120
Acceleration is normal.  Escape velocity
reached. Take off is successful.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.840
Where was the launch
site of those missiles ?

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.110
3000 km east southeast from here.

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:07.980
Damn, this floating island
is also a Gamilus base.

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:12.280
All hands, the Yamato will fly at maximum
throttle to escape the gravity field.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.720
Fasten safety belts.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.810
Captain, let me destroy
the Gamilus base.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:24.340
Kodai, escape is our
first priority now.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:36.270
Shima, go at full power to catch up to
the floating island and match its orbit.

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.380
Same orbit ?

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.100
Yes, hurry.

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:41.280
Aye, sir.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.900
Captain, we've matched
the floating island's orbit.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:54.800
Alright, main staff, come to
the central planning room.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.950
{KORE}That is the Yamato.  One more orbit,
and we'll catch up to the floating island.

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.870
{KYUU}It's an emergency,
so I'll explain briefly.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:06.670
{YAMATO}The Yamato is going at full power
in the orbit of the floating island...

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:09.430
{YAMATO}...and it'll catch
up at this point.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:12.340
{SEIKAKU}More precisely, 100,000 km
up and behind the island.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.060
Kodai.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:13.610
Sir.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.160
Destroy the Gamilus base.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:19.530
But we can't afford to waste time,
so you have to do it in one shot.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:22.780
Captain, it's the
Wave Motion gun, isn't it ?

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:26.100
Wait, won't it be too
risky without testing it first ?

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:29.810
The Yamato might be
damaged by the shock.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:31.020
Captain...

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:36.520
Do it. All the tests have to be
finished as early as possible.

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:38.220
B...but...Captain.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.540
Mr. Sanada, let's do it.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:44.260
Failing now or later won't
make much of a difference.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:46.650
In any case,
let's do our best.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:53.600
Kodai, let me explain how
the Wave Motion gun works.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:59.320
The Wave Motion gun uses the energy
directly from the Wave Motion engine.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:03.230
{KONO}Its energy is as big
as a small galaxy.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:07.340
{KORE}This energy is charged
and fired in one direction.

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:14.630
{SONOTAME}So, after it fires, the engine
loses all power and thrust.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:22.430
{FUTATABI}In order to restart
the Wave Motion engine...

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:26.600
{FUTATABI}...all the ship's electricity
must be turned off and saved.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.370
All hands, take your
positions at once.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:38.900
Commander, the Yamato is in the
same orbit as the floating island.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:41.560
What are they going to do ?

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.110
Turn off all power.

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:44.780
Aye, sir.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:59.500
Pressurize the Wave Motion engine.
Close all the emergency valves.

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:02.570
Pressurizing the engine.
Closing the emergency valves.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.970
Open the channel to
the Wave Motion gun.

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:10.990
Opening the channel.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:14.410
Chamber pressure of the
Wave Motion gun is increasing.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.820
All energy is directed to the Wave Motion
gun.  Compulsive injector, activated.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.790
Release the safety device
of the Wave Motion gun.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.350
Releasing safety device
of the Wave Motion gun.

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:26.950
Safety lock is zero.  Pressure
is reaching firing level in 02.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.950
Unlocking the final safety.
Pressure is reaching maximum.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:39.610
Floating island, confirmed.
100,000 km ahead.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:49.330
Prepare to fire
the Wave Motion gun.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.140
Shima, transfer
control to Kodai.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.600
Kodai, it's yours.
Do it.

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:54.590
Leave it to me.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.850
Aiming the bow
towards the island.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:11.130
Target scope, open.
Virtual cross hair, visibility is 20.

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:17.120
Target speed is
40 space knots.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.750
Tachyon particle
flow is increasing.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:23.140
Ten seconds to firing.
Prepare for shock and flash.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:32.780
Five...

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:33.430
...four...

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:34.210
...three...

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.140
...two...

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:35.980
...one...

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:36.860
...zero.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:37.720
Fire !

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.690
Commander Shultz,
the island is...

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.330
Floating island base,
what happened ?

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:02.220
Respond, floating island base.

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:08.900
No, the Yamato...

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:17.800
Direct the Wave Motion
engine energy to thrusters.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:26.290
Wave Motion engine started.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:30.000
Shima, use the overboost. Don't worry
about overheating. Just step on it.

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:55.160
You did it.

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:13.540
We escaped from
Jupiter's gravity.

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:17.290
That was the
Wave Motion gun.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:19.840
The floating island
itself was destroyed.

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:22.560
Did we commit
something unforgivable ?

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:26.620
We only had to destroy
the Gamilus base, didn't we ?

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:30.040
The Wave Motion gun
is a valuable power...

00:22:30.040 --> 00:22:36.270
...but we also realized that it's an excessively
destructive weapon, if we misuse it.

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:39.140
We need to think carefully
before we use it.

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:52.570
The Yamato has
left Jupiter.

00:22:52.570 --> 00:22:55.710
On top of that, the Yamato
destroyed the floating island.

00:22:55.710 --> 00:22:57.760
What was that weapon ?

00:22:57.760 --> 00:22:58.810
What was that...?

00:22:59.360 --> 00:23:00.300
What was that...?

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:06.630
Space battleship Yamato,
148,000 light years is far.

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:10.070
Only one year
is given to you.

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:13.280
Earth is waiting for the
radioactive poison purifier...

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:16.960
...while desperately
fighting the contamination.

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:22.740
Mankind is said to face
extinction in 361 days.

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:28.370
361 days left to the
extinction of mankind.

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:36.230
361 days left

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:43.550
Okita Juzo:

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:43.550
Naya Goro

00:23:41.930 --> 00:23:50.530
Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:49.560
Narrator:

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:49.560
Kimura Akira

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:59.920
Note:
The Yamato left Mars, and headed for Jupiter. However, in 2199, Jupiter should be 180 degrees from Mars, back toward Earth.

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:59.920
They must have referred to the Voyager plan, and thought that Jupiter and Mars are close.

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:59.330
Dareno tame da to omotte iruka

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:07.630
Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:09.920
Note:
In the scene where the Yamato fires the Wave Motion gun, they forgot to remove the Yamato cell, showing it under the trail of the energy.

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:16.530
Minna sono ki de ireba ii

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:15.920
Note:
The chief animator of this episode was Kenzo Koizumi, but Mr. Ashida was credited.
There was no chief animator for the episodes done by Studio Mates here after.

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:23.050
Translation

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:23.050
Editing

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:24.930
Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa

00:24:23.050 --> 00:24:30.620
Timing

00:24:23.050 --> 00:24:30.620
Song Translations

00:24:24.930 --> 00:24:32.530
Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa

00:24:30.620 --> 00:24:38.620
A

00:24:32.530 --> 00:24:36.530
La la la...

00:24:36.530 --> 00:24:40.530
La la la...

00:24:40.530 --> 00:24:50.430
La la la, makka na scarf
